        "description": "Collects security-awareness programme data from a RansomLeak tenant over its REST API and indexes it as five sourcetypes, using five independently configurable modular inputs: Phishing Events (simulation outcomes -- opens, clicks, attachment opens, credential submissions, OAuth grants and reports), Audit Events (identity and administrative security events -- sign-in, MFA, SCIM provisioning, password, role, licence, API-token and tenant-settings changes), Training State (per-enrollment assignment, due and completion state), Risk Posture (human risk score and overdue-assignment counts, optionally faceted by team) and Programme Metrics (tenant-level aggregates such as training completion rate, phishing click and report rates, and assignments by category). Audit events are normalised to the Common Information Model and populate the Authentication and Change data models. The add-on also ships a custom alert action, Assign RansomLeak training, which assigns a RansomLeak exercise to each user named in a triggering search's results, and five Dashboard Studio views (Overview, Phishing, Identity, Training, Health). Requires a RansomLeak tenant and an API token.",
